<title>SOUTH AFRICA: St Helena raises Sept qtr profit.</title>
<headline>St Helena raises Sept qtr profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distrib profit		   6.63 vs 4.15</p>
<p>    Capital spending		 0.58 vs 1.04</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		 192,000 vs 180,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		1,168 vs   1,094</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		    6.1 vs same</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		 51,180 vs 50,917</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)	    55,174 vs 53,147</p>
<p>Full name: St Helena Gold Mines Ltd, owned by Gencor Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
